@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@adminToken = <PUT_ADMIN_JWT_HERE>
@customerToken = <PUT_CUSTOMER_JWT_HERE>

### Notes
# Replace @adminToken and @customerToken with JWTs containing claims as used in project (NameIdentifier, Role, BranchID, AreaID).
# The seeder creates sample IDs; use them if needed:
# adminUserId = dddddddd-dddd-dddd-dddd-dddddddddddd
# customerUserId = eeeeeeee-eeee-eeee-eeee-eeeeeeeeeeee
# customerId = ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff

### LOYALTY - Earn points (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/loyalty/earn/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff?points=50&description=Order+#123
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### LOYALTY - Redeem points (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/loyalty/redeem/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff?points=20&description=Redeem+for+voucher
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### LOYALTY - History (Customer or Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/loyalty/history/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### PROMOTIONS - Admin create promotion
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/promotions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Code": "WELCOME10",
  "Title": "Welcome 10%",
  "Description": "10% off for new customers",
  "StartAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "EndAt": "2030-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "IsActive": true,
  "BranchId": null
}

### PROMOTIONS - Get public promotions (Customer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/promotions/public

### PROMOTIONS - Assign promotion to customer (Admin)
# Replace <promotionId-from-create-response> with the returned id from create above
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/promotions/assign/<promotionId-from-create-response>
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

["ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff"]

### PROMOTIONS - Customer wallet
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/promotions/wallet/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### PROMOTIONS - Apply voucher (Customer) - mark as used
# Example: apply code WELCOME10
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/promotions/apply?code=WELCOME10&orderId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### FEEDBACK - Customer send feedback
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/feedbacks
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "BranchId": "bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb",
  "ProductId": null,
  "Rating": 5,
  "Content": "Great coffee and service!",
  "AreaId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa"
}

### FEEDBACK - Admin list feedbacks (apply filters)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/feedbacks/list
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Status": null,
  "Rating": null,
  "BranchId": null,
  "Page": 1,
  "PageSize": 20
}

### FEEDBACK - Admin reply
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/feedbacks/<feedbackId>/reply
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Status": "Resolved",
  "ResponseContent": "Thank you for your feedback. We will reward you next time."
}

### SURVEYS - Admin create survey
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/surveys
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Title": "Customer Satisfaction Survey",
  "Description": "Short survey about store experience",
  "StartAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "EndAt": "2030-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "Questions": [
    { "QuestionKey": "q1", "QuestionText": "How do you rate our coffee?" },
    { "QuestionKey": "q2", "QuestionText": "How do you rate our service?" }
  ],
  "IsActive": true
}

### SURVEYS - Admin send survey to customers
# Replace <surveyId> with returned id from create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/surveys/send/<surveyId>
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

["ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff"]

### SURVEYS - Admin analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/surveys/<surveyId>/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### SURVEYS - Customer get active surveys
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/surveys/active
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### SURVEYS - Customer submit survey
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/surveys/<surveyId>/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "CustomerId": "ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff",
  "Answers": [
    { "QuestionKey": "q1", "Answer": "5" },
    { "QuestionKey": "q2", "Answer": "5" }
  ]
}

### STATS CRM - Admin overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stats/crm/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# End of file
